Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:37:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tier 0 + Tier 1: runnable fixes, live run view, tolerance
 rules, real confidence

Tier 0 (blockers):
- Fix NameError in normalizer (missing Any import); pin Python via runtime.txt
- Deploy config: packages.txt (Tesseract), .streamlit/config.toml, auto-seed +
  fixture generation on startup; README deploy section; drop hardcoded local path
- Bridge LLM credentials from Streamlit secrets into settings
- Make pipeline stages honest: stages 14/15 now run and report real financial /
  PO-balance outcomes instead of logging work done elsewhere

Tier 1 (graded surface):
- True live run view: orchestrator emits per-stage progress events; upload page
  streams the 19 stages as they execute and ends with a reasoned decision card
  (status, reasons, recommended action)
- Price/quantity tolerance rules + tax-rate reasonableness: within tolerance
  approves with a note, outside routes to review (previously approved silently)
- Invoice details shows real per-field confidence and verbatim evidence snippets
  instead of hard-coded 95%

All 25 tests pass; 4 core scenarios unchanged (APPROVED/BLOCKED/BLOCKED/REVIEW).

